# B MAJOR PENTATONIC - a scale to hear, play along with, and read. Made by PokeyTracker's
# scale songs (File > New scale song), by rule: every note follows from the scale's steps.
# Five notes, the major scale without its fourth and seventh: no note clashes, which is why it is everywhere.
# Going up:   B3 C#4 D#4 F#4 G#4 B4
# The format is in Demo1/CLAUDE.md, under "Song files".

song   B MAJOR PENTATONIC
key    B MAJOR

# A soft piano-like voice on the 16-bit table: every note within two cents of true.
instrument PIANO
  table      wide
  volume     14 13 12 11 10 10 9 9 8 8 7 7 7 6
  distortion tone
  release    3

instrument HOME_NOTE
  table      wide
  volume     7 7 6
  distortion tone
  release    2

channel 1 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of channel 2's 16-bit divider. AUDCTL 78 joins 1 and 2, and 3 and 4.

channel 2 notes HOME
  note  The home note, held low under the scale when the drone is on - every note of the
  note  scale is heard against it, which is how a scale's character is learned. The lines
  note  play it where they name HOME; put . there to leave it out.
  voice HOME_NOTE
  track HOME B1 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

channel 3 pair LOW BYTE
  note  The low byte of channel 4's 16-bit divider.

channel 4 notes SCALE
  note  B Major Pentatonic: one octave up and down in quarter notes, two in eighths,
  note  and the home chord as an arpeggio.
  voice PIANO
  track O1 B3 . . .  C#4 . . .  D#4 . . .  F#4 . . .
  track O2 G#4 . . .  B4 . . .  G#4 . . .  F#4 . . .
  track O3 D#4 . . .  C#4 . . .  B3 . . .  . . . .
  track T1 B3 . C#4 .  D#4 . F#4 .  G#4 . B4 .  C#5 . D#5 .
  track T2 F#5 . G#5 .  B5 . G#5 .  F#5 . D#5 .  C#5 . B4 .
  track T3 G#4 . F#4 .  D#4 . C#4 .  B3 . . .  . . . .
  track A1 B3 . . .  D#4 . . .  F#4 . . .  B4 . . .
  track A2 D#5 . . .  F#5 . . .  B5 . . .  F#5 . . .
  track A3 D#5 . . .  B4 . . .  F#4 . . .  D#4 . . .
  track A4 B3 . . .  . . . .  . . . .  . . . .

# The order list: the scale's sections, then the song ends.
audctl $78
speed  11
section ONE OCTAVE
line   .  .     .  O1
line   .  .     .  O2
line   .  .     .  O3
section TWO OCTAVES
line   .  .     .  T1
line   .  .     .  T2
line   .  .     .  T3
section ARPEGGIO
line   .  .     .  A1
line   .  .     .  A2
line   .  .     .  A3
line   .  .     .  A4
end
